{"ref":"BDB, מִצְרִי","hw":"מִצְרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְרִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent. Egyptian</strong>;—ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:1\" href=\"/Genesis.39.1\">Gn 39:1</a> + 16 times; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְרִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:1\" href=\"/Genesis.16.1\">16:1</a> + 3 times; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:12\" href=\"/Genesis.12.12\">12:12</a> + 5 times; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְרִיֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:19\" href=\"/Exodus.1.19\">Ex 1:19</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  adj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מ׳</span>=<em>an Egyptian</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:1\" href=\"/Genesis.39.1\">Gn 39:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:11\" href=\"/Exodus.2.11\">Ex 2:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:19\" href=\"/Exodus.2.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.10\">Lv 24:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.11\">1 S 30:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.30\">2 S 23:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאִישׁ הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">1 Ch 11:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעַר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.13\">1 S 30:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבֶד מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.34\">1 Ch 2:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁפְחָה מִצְרִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:1\" href=\"/Genesis.16.1\">Gn 16:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּנָּשִׁים הַמִּצְרִיֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:19\" href=\"/Exodus.1.19\">Ex 1:19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  c. art.=subst. <em>the Egyptian</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:2\" href=\"/Genesis.39.2\">Gn 39:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:5\" href=\"/Genesis.39.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:12\" href=\"/Exodus.2.12\">Ex 2:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:14\" href=\"/Exodus.2.14\">14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.30\">2 S 23:30</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">1 Ch 11:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; so once without art. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.8\">Dt 23:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּצְרִי</span> once (late) coll.=<em>the Egyptians</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" href=\"/Ezra.9.1\">Ezr 9:1</a> (where with Canaanitish peoples); pl.=<em>the Egyptians</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָמִּצְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:12\" href=\"/Genesis.12.12\">Gn 12:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:14\" href=\"/Genesis.12.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:32\" href=\"/Genesis.43.32\">43:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.6\">Dt 26:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:7\" href=\"/Joshua.24.7\">Jos 24:7</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָגָר הַמִּצְרִית</span> <em>Hagar the Egyptian woman</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:3\" href=\"/Genesis.16.3\">Gn 16:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:9\" href=\"/Genesis.21.9\">21:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:12\" href=\"/Genesis.25.12\">25:12</a>.","next":"BDB, מְצֻרָה","prev":"BDB, מָצוֹר³"}